# MilkDrop Pack Import — Research & Feature Spec

Status: **🔬 Research complete — ready for design review**
Last updated: 2026-06-02

> Goal: Expand the existing import modal to let users browse and install curated
> MilkDrop preset packs directly from GitHub — turning DiscoCast into a platform
> where users can stack thousands (even tens of thousands) of additional presets
> with a single click.

