### Phase 2c — Install Flow + Progress Bar

**Goal:** Click [Install] → download → unzip → store → progress feedback.

**Modify:** `src/packInstaller.js` (generalize from Phase 1c) +
`src/packBrowser.js` (progress UI).

**Progress states per card:**
```
IDLE        → [Install] button (primary accent)
DOWNLOADING → "Downloading... 45%" (progress bar, spinner)
EXTRACTING  → "Extracting presets..." (indeterminate)
STORING     → "Storing: 8,432 / 15,056" (progress bar)
DONE        → "✓ 15,056 presets installed" (success, then → INSTALLED)
INSTALLED   → "✓ Installed" badge + [Remove] button (secondary)
ERROR       → "⚠ Failed: ..." + [Retry]
```

**Download with progress:**
```js
const response = await fetch(url);
const reader = response.body.getReader();
const contentLength = +response.headers.get('Content-Length');
let received = 0;
const chunks = [];
while (true) {
    const { done, value } = await reader.read();
    if (done) break;
    chunks.push(value);
    received += value.length;
    onProgress({ phase: 'download', current: received, total: contentLength });
}
```

